<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLBA0C9B06019" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Back Panel Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Fuel filler door panel 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9806017"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0159.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "114.882mm" ver = "01" gw = "468" gh = "309"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06019001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Unscrew 6 bolts.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove back panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0035.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "160.253mm" ver = "01" gw = "418" gh = "438"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0036.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "79.378mm" ver = "01" gw = "422" gh = "208"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.394in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "5.169in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
<symbol name = "MANOTE" width = "5.132mm" height = "3.048mm"/>
:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
This symbol indicates that back panel and rear lamp house outer panel are replaced at the same time.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06019002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Proceed repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install back panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten 6 bolts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0037.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "155.723mm" ver = "01" gw = "408" gh = "425"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0038.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "99.251mm" ver = "01" gw = "459" gh = "265"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
